  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Det &#xf6;vergripande m&#xe5;let med projektet &#xe4;r att ge ungdomar fr&#xe5;n          ytteromr&#xe5;dena kring Cochabamba och La Paz yrkesutbildning f&#xf6;r att     m&#xf6;jligg&#xf6;ra tilltr&#xe4;de till  arbetsmarknad och effektiv                 fattigdomsbek&#xe4;mpning.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of the project is that girls and boys, young women and men receive entrepreneur technical education that enable their    participation in the development of their communities with support    from their families and the community.</narrative>
  </description>
